  "description": "<p>This mod lets you know when you are near a quest item by showing a progress bar that goes further the closer you are. An optional arrow can also be toggled (on by default) that points towards the objective. The size of the area where the mod triggers can be configured.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NJSwcdr.gif\" alt=\"Preview\" /></p>\n<p>You can support me on Ko-Fi</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/lacyway\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click</a></p>\n",
